{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>出爐香港小姐冠軍袁絲珩向來充滿活力，近日她再度出動，相約好姊妹湯家琳齊齊去球場打匹克球做運動。事後，她在社交平台上載多張充滿動感的花絮靚相，並配文甜笑留言：「多謝飯腳陪我做運動🤣🥎💕」。</p><p></p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"16557bbc-067a-40de-8997-5857813fd83d.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Uf7VKQmmRn1792551077.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>從分享的照片中所見，袁絲珩當日以一身青春運動造型示人。她穿上粉白色的短款運動背心，下身配搭黑色短褲，並戴上型格太陽眼鏡，大方展露纖細的小蠻腰與修長美腿，渾身散發著青春健美的氣息。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"58ca7a05-d119-4840-970c-5966f2ecbe10.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Y7AbCCKara1792551076.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>兩位好姊妹在球場上拿著球拍開心合照，不但擺出多個活力十足的甫士，更齊齊對著鏡頭嘟嘴賣萌，足見兩人私下感情相當深厚要好。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T03:20:17.526212+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T02:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T03:37:51.341773+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T03:17:41.242790+00:00","content_hash":"39e331eeb9f94bf42ffc53ac69c84af81546dd66e8246a7dd7460644fc26ea5a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}